<title>INDIA: TABLE-India April steel output falls to 1.05 mln T.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India April steel output falls to 1.05 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's steel output fell to 1.05 million tonnes in April from 1.13 million in the same month in 1996, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    STEEL OUTPUT  April	April	Apr-Mar	Apr-Mar</p>
<p>			 1997	 1996	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p>		    1,046.5    1,134.4     14,210.7     13,982.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes unless stated and are preliminary. They cover India's main plants.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
